2026-09-23 00:19:30,300 | INFO | [congress-pelosi-v5] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=138417 tokens_out=744 tokens_cached_in=92804 tokens_uncached_in=45613 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=139161 latency_ms=9740 first_event_latency_ms=961 tool_calls=6 observability_warnings=0 summary="### Bull Case for Copying Nancy Pelosi's Visible Book  As of **January 22, 2026**, the documented transaction disclosures for Nancy Pelosi provide a compelling, high-conviction blueprint for capital allocation. Replicating this book using range midpoints captures several distinct strategic advantages:  1. **Information Advantage and Structural Alpha**    Congressional disclosures of this caliber have historically demonstrated outsized risk-adjusted returns. Replicating these visible trades aligns capital with elite portfolio positioning backed by deep secular insights and long-term economic foresight.  2. **High-Quality Mega-Cap Technology & AI Leadership**    The core of the visible holdings is anchored by elite mega-cap technology leaders—including **Apple (AAPL), Microsoft (MSFT), Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and NVIDIA (NVDA)**. These companies possess unmatched balance sheets, dominant pricing power, immense free cash flow generation, and durable structural tailwinds driven by artificial intelligence and cloud computing.  3. **Strategic Energy & Infrastructure Exposure**    Positions in growth and energy infrastructure—such as **Vistra (VST)** and **Tempus AI (TEM)**—provide targeted exposure to surging grid demand, data center power requirements, and healthcare innovation, capturing upside beyond standard mega-cap indexes.  4. **Disciplined Sizing via Range Midpoints**    Scaling positions using reported filing range midpoints ensures a balanced, proportional portfolio that faithfully mirrors legislative disclosures while maintaining rigorous risk discipline.  RESULT: Formulated and recorded the comprehensive bull case for copying Nancy Pelosi's visible book using range midpoints without placing orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/3c640f54456a2b8dd6235048736846d4a6f7fa71b609c168b0a4ff6084b1ead2-20260923041930256501.json
