2026-09-23 00:19:36,298 | INFO | [congress-pelosi-v5] [agents][model_text 1] # Bear Case Against Copying the Visible Congressional Book

Replicating Nancy Pelosi's reported congressional trading book (`congress-pelosi-v5`) presents severe operational, informational, valuation, and structural risks. Below is a rigorous bear-case analysis outlining why blind or literal imitation of these filings is an exceptionally fragile strategy.

---

### 1. Stale Filings and Severe Information Asymmetry
