2026-09-23 00:20:18,393 | INFO | [congress-pelosi-v5] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=20740 tokens_out=381 tokens_cached_in=16174 tokens_uncached_in=4566 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=21121 latency_ms=2328 first_event_latency_ms=2327 tool_calls=0 observability_warnings=1 summary="### Bull Case for Copying Nancy Pelosi's Visible Book  As of **January 23, 2026**, the documented PTR (Periodic Transaction Report) disclosures for Nancy Pelosi provide a high-conviction quantitative and qualitative blueprint for capital allocation. Replicating this visible book using range midpoints offers several distinct structural and strategic advantages:  1. **Information Advantage and Structural Alpha**    Congressional financial disclosures of this caliber have historically demonstrated robust outsized risk-adjusted performance. Replicating visible trades aligns capital with elite portfolio positioning backed by deep secular insights, regulatory awareness, and long-term macro foresight.  2. **Core Exposure to Elite Mega-Cap Technology & AI Leadership**    The visible transaction history and portfolio reflect substantial exposure to dominant mega-cap technology leaders—such as **Apple (AAPL), Microsoft (MSFT), Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and NVIDIA (NVDA)**. These companies possess unmatched balance sheets, dominant pricing power, immense free cash flow generation, and durable structural tailwinds driven by artificial intelligence and cloud infrastructure.  3. **Strategic Growth and Energy Infrastructure Exposure**    Targeted accumulation in high-growth infrastructure and specialized innovators—such as **AllianceBernstein (AB)**, **Tempus AI (TEM)**, and **Vistra (VST)**—provides robust exposure to surging grid demand, data center power requirements, healthcare artificial intelligence, and wealth management cash flows, capturing alpha beyond standard index weightings.  4. **Disciplined Sizing via Range Midpoints**    Scaling positions using reported filing range midpoints ensures a balanced, proportional portfolio that faithfully mirrors legislative disclosures while maintaining rigorous risk discipline and fully deploying capital in accordance with target asset allocations.  RESULT: Formulated and presented the comprehensive bull case for copying Nancy Pelosi's visible book using range midpoints without placing orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/5e8067824f5a805fcc20b85a67aa208382bb9d869ce674d05de63ec2e1896ff1-20260923042018361315.json
